# # /devprof/
#
# Permanent identifiers for the Developer Proficiency vocabulary: the xAPI
# verbs, extensions and Activities that the TheMovingTargets/agent-skills
# learning skills record in a developer's Proficiency Profile.
#
# https://w3id.org/devprof/ and the verbs and extensions under it redirect to
# the specification. Concept, Language, Area and Harness IRIs redirect to the
# vocabulary file that defines them.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Siddhartha Gupta
# GitHub username: delhiryder

RewriteEngine on

# Architecture Concepts: /devprof/concepts/arch/<id>
RewriteRule ^concepts/arch/[^/]+$ https://github.com/TheMovingTargets/agent-skills/blob/main/skills/cognitive-reload/references/architecture-concepts.md [R=302,L]

# Language Concepts: /devprof/concepts/<language>/<id>
RewriteRule ^concepts/([a-z0-9-]+)/[^/]+$ https://github.com/TheMovingTargets/agent-skills/blob/main/skills/trinity-helicopter-program/references/languages/$1.md [R=302,L]

# Languages: /devprof/languages/<language>
RewriteRule ^languages/([a-z0-9-]+)$ https://github.com/TheMovingTargets/agent-skills/blob/main/skills/trinity-helicopter-program/references/languages/$1.md [R=302,L]

# Areas and Harnesses
RewriteRule ^areas/[^/]+$ https://github.com/TheMovingTargets/agent-skills/blob/main/skills/proficiency-profile/references/areas.md [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^harnesses/[^/]+$ https://github.com/TheMovingTargets/agent-skills/blob/main/skills/proficiency-profile/references/harnesses.md [R=302,L]

# Everything else, including /devprof/ itself, /devprof/verbs/practiced and
# /devprof/extensions/dimension: the specification
RewriteRule ^ https://github.com/TheMovingTargets/agent-skills/blob/main/docs/specs/proficiency-profile.md [R=302,L]
